    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EOPRISM is the educational puzzler that Millennial &amp; Gen Z gamers wished they grew up with. You'll shoot solutions at your foes and obstacles as you quickly solve mathematical expressions in our 3 available game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/f5a3a6904dda0c47140d9b9b70e5f97c.poster.avif?t=1743053186\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/f5a3a6904dda0c47140d9b9b70e5f97c.webm?t=1743053186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/f5a3a6904dda0c47140d9b9b70e5f97c.mp4?t=1743053186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong> is a short but re-playable adventure where no two runs are the same. Jump between quadrants, dodge tricky tangents, and foil The Ianfinite's (Villain) calculated plans with the future of Math. With procedurally generated equations, every playthrough is a fresh challenge in an endless loop of fast-paced problem-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/78d15d59f7937f66f259441292965d2f.poster.avif?t=1743053186\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/78d15d59f7937f66f259441292965d2f.webm?t=1743053186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/78d15d59f7937f66f259441292965d2f.mp4?t=1743053186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Practice Mode</strong> reinvents flash cards with a dynamic, customizable challenge. Train your wits from basic algebra to college calculus in an interactive, fast-paced way\u2014no boring drills, just pure number-crunching action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/5058f9411ebf88fba056c93e710c4610.poster.avif?t=1743053186\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/5058f9411ebf88fba056c93e710c4610.webm?t=1743053186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/5058f9411ebf88fba056c93e710c4610.mp4?t=1743053186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Challenge Mode (Coming Soon)</strong> brings fast-paced, split-screen action to local co-op. Team up for advanced mini-games, survive endless enemy waves, or battle it out in PvP to be crowned GCF (Greatest Calculator Fighter)<strong>.</strong> Whether cooperating or competing, it\u2019s math-driven mayhem at its finest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EOPRISM will contain <strong>5 Story Mode Missions</strong>, <strong>1 Practice Mode Level</strong>, and <strong>2 Challenge Modes.\u00a0</strong>Sharpen your math skills and test your aim! Perfect your formulas and get your calculations ready for the real fight. No pressure, just pure number-crunching fun!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EOPRISM is the educational puzzler that Millennial &amp; Gen Z gamers wished they grew up with. You'll shoot solutions at your foes and obstacles as you quickly solve mathematical expressions in our 3 available game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/f5a3a6904dda0c47140d9b9b70e5f97c.poster.avif?t=1743053186\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/f5a3a6904dda0c47140d9b9b70e5f97c.webm?t=1743053186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/f5a3a6904dda0c47140d9b9b70e5f97c.mp4?t=1743053186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong> is a short but re-playable adventure where no two runs are the same. Jump between quadrants, dodge tricky tangents, and foil The Ianfinite's (Villain) calculated plans with the future of Math. With procedurally generated equations, every playthrough is a fresh challenge in an endless loop of fast-paced problem-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/78d15d59f7937f66f259441292965d2f.poster.avif?t=1743053186\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/78d15d59f7937f66f259441292965d2f.webm?t=1743053186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/78d15d59f7937f66f259441292965d2f.mp4?t=1743053186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Practice Mode</strong> reinvents flash cards with a dynamic, customizable challenge. Train your wits from basic algebra to college calculus in an interactive, fast-paced way\u2014no boring drills, just pure number-crunching action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/5058f9411ebf88fba056c93e710c4610.poster.avif?t=1743053186\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/5058f9411ebf88fba056c93e710c4610.webm?t=1743053186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364130/extras/5058f9411ebf88fba056c93e710c4610.mp4?t=1743053186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Challenge Mode (Coming Soon)</strong> brings fast-paced, split-screen action to local co-op. Team up for advanced mini-games, survive endless enemy waves, or battle it out in PvP to be crowned GCF (Greatest Calculator Fighter)<strong>.</strong> Whether cooperating or competing, it\u2019s math-driven mayhem at its finest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EOPRISM will contain <strong>5 Story Mode Missions</strong>, <strong>1 Practice Mode Level</strong>, and <strong>2 Challenge Modes.\u00a0</strong>Sharpen your math skills and test your aim! Perfect your formulas and get your calculations ready for the real fight. No pressure, just pure number-crunching fun!</p>",
    "short_description": "Join the fight in EOPRISM, a math shooter where you battle foes to stop Ianfinite\u2019s Order of Operations! After the Day of Tessellation, this alien seeks control with the EOPRISM crystal. Solve puzzles, face calculator creatures, and restore balance before Ianfinite\u2019s chaotic plans become limitless!",
